scenario boost over g5_scen_decisions
  tally 2
  from 2026-01-01

move top: transfers
  on from_day
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to konto amount min(top_amt, bal(konto))

move lift: transfers
  on late_day
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to konto amount min(lift_amt, bal(konto))

ask q_boost: bal(konto, 2026-01-05) in boost
